WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,920
The gentle and protective system slays demons and deceives the human race

2
00:00:01,920 --> 00:00:04,440
It's my honor to be able to protect him.

3
00:00:04,440 --> 00:00:06,960
What does this have to do with you? Who are you? Why are you like this?

4
00:00:06,960 --> 00:00:07,880
I'm helping you

5
00:00:07,880 --> 00:00:10,240
Stop being so sentimental, you are making me unwilling to accept it

6
00:00:10,240 --> 00:00:11,360
Just apply to be an executor

7
00:00:11,360 --> 00:00:12,680
