9
00:00:13,680 --> 00:00:14,960
It turns out you are self-aware

10
00:00:14,960 --> 00:00:17,000
No strength, no talent to enjoy the protection of others

11
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:17,920
Still bother taking a bite

12
00:00:17,920 --> 00:00:20,360
You are a wolf with a heart and a dog with lungs

13
00:00:20,360 --> 00:00:25,360
What's the fuss about?

14
00:00:25,360 --> 00:00:28,000
As expected, someone fanned the flames of Captain

15
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:29,800
Can I really not release ghosts?

16
00:00:29,800 --> 00:00:31,080
You haven't sent that ghost away yet

17
00:00:33,070 --> 00:00:34,590
Better not

18
00:00:34,670 --> 00:00:43,530
Got it, let's go

19
00:00:43,530 --> 00:00:44,960
What a ghost

20
00:00:44,960 --> 00:00:46,280
in various senses

21
00:00:46,280 --> 00:00:51,550
It will be fine if a good person carries ghosts with him and sees more of them.
